From: OpenHarmony PC Developer Community <dev@openharmony.org>
Date: 2026-03-27
Subject: [PATCH] ctypes/util.py: skip ldconfig on HarmonyOS

Add HarmonyOS platform guard to skip ldconfig (not available).

Applies to: CPython 3.9.0
---
--- a/Lib/ctypes/util.py	2020-10-05 23:07:58.000000000 +0800
+++ b/Lib/ctypes/util.py	2026-03-26 17:51:51.307166250 +0800
@@ -255,6 +255,9 @@
     else:
 
         def _findSoname_ldconfig(name):
+            # HarmonyOS: no /sbin/ldconfig, skip to avoid SubprocessError
+            if sys.platform.startswith(('ohos', 'harmonyos')):
+                return None
             import struct
             if struct.calcsize('l') == 4:
                 machine = os.uname().machine + '-32'
